# TheSports API 프록시 — Vercel 이 ts IP 화이트리스트를 넘도록 고정 IP 로 대리 호출 (포트 8788)
[Unit]
Description=Scorebase TheSports API Proxy (fixed-IP relay for Vercel)
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=ubuntu
WorkingDirectory=/home/ubuntu/scorebase-worker
ExecStart=/usr/bin/node /home/ubuntu/scorebase-worker/src/ts-proxy.js
Restart=always
RestartSec=5
StandardOutput=append:/home/ubuntu/scorebase-worker/logs/ts-proxy.log
StandardError=append:/home/ubuntu/scorebase-worker/logs/ts-proxy.err

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
